  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1.5 teaspoons white sugar",
    "0.75 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 cup vegetable oil",
    "2 tablespoons milk",
    "4 cups apples - peeled, cored, and cut into chunks",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "1 tablespoon all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "0.5 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.25 cup brown sugar",
    "0.25 cup unsalted butter, cubed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-JdZSvcXq1UkIUmBPe4gH6hI-WI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/283371-french-apple-pie-VAT-step-01-038c9f59d8254658993aba12dedad347.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283371/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the crust: Mix flour, sugar, and salt together in a bowl. Whisk oil and milk together in a separate bowl, then add to the dry mixture. Mix to combine and press into a 10-inch pie plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0ojGKjYJ-pE2Hg3arM16b8yIu2Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/283371-french-apple-pie-VAT-step-02-db38e981265546c29e7c98e168e0495d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283371/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the filling: Mix apples, sugar, flour, and cinnamon together in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rLLPpOf7jvPp6hl67NVJiJWiojY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/283371-french-apple-pie-VAT-step-03-f641450c732a438ba60d6cf4561b665d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283371/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place on top of the unbaked crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tgNREF_ileFc9S3nUkNinBywfRI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/283371-french-apple-pie-VAT-step-04-3fafc04d4e3640b9bbc0865b9cc3fc02.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283371/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the topping: Mix flour, brown sugar, and butter in a bowl with a fork until crumbles are formed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5jbRMLyR-VKANZVX3RLp99VIIuw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/283371-french-apple-pie-VAT-step-05-f24993e2ccef44f6a88dd00f97a74f87.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283371/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle on top of apple filling.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0SrsS3WPn3wvB6ai4yswc6qxtg4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/283371-french-apple-pie-VAT-step-06-b0cad3725b7b4403b27d3b15bb5c37bf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283371/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until filling is bubbly and topping is golden brown, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZBUZtUNRyxK3jvUEvC-aeac9qDU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/283371-french-apple-pie-VAT-step-07-a4e8abd7786c40c9a29e66b637a3983f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283371/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Allow to cool briefly. Serve and enjoy!",
